  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Enterprise Grants for the Common Good</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nonprofit philanthropy should contribute more than marginal economic improvements. A more holistic approach is needed for transformational outcomes, enabling marginalized groups to sustain their own economic prosperity. Donations made through Common Good will support small business needs in the US and Guatemala, fostering a cooperative partnership with small-business entrepreneurs, rather than a lender-borrower relationship. The Common Good&apos;s goal is to assist in long-term wealth creation.</narrative>
  </description>
